              "attribution": "Contemporary Issues: Aboriginal Studies 30 (Les Éditions Duval, 2005)",
              "contextLimits": "Tootoo's firsts: NHL debut 2003, Achievement Award 2002.",
              "creator": "Contemporary Issues textbook authors",
              "extract": "Jordin Tootoo is the first Inuk athlete to play in the National Hockey League. On October 9, 2003, he played his first shift for the Nashville Predators. He won a National Aboriginal Achievement Award in 2002.",
