              "attribution": "Contemporary Issues: Aboriginal Studies 30 (Les Éditions Duval, 2005)",
              "contextLimits": "Calgary Community Conferencing: every voice heard, offender proposing the fix.",
              "creator": "Contemporary Issues textbook authors",
