              "contextLimits": "Question 16, Television row: outside values beamed at reserve children.",
              "creator": "Contemporary Issues textbook authors",
              "extract": "On reserves today, as in other locations in Canada, children are drawn to the ideas and values reflected on television.",
              "locator": "Chapter 6, printed p. 185 (supplied PDF p. 193)",
              "sourceType": "Textbook narration",
              "title": "Source G",
